	(text "Power-path behaviour (TI BQ24074 SLUS810N):\n  V6P0 present: OUT regulated to 4.4V, battery charged at 100mA (ILIM 0.5A total). V6P0 lost: OUT connects to VBAT with no glitch;\n  TPS62A01 keeps +3V3 up -> BLE/MCU keep running; TCAN4550 loses VSUP (bus off) and is held in reset by MCU."
